---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - AI Online Protractor"
  description="Privacy Policy for AI Online Protractor (aionlineprotractor.com). Learn how we handle your data, cookies, and local browser storage."
  canonical="https://aionlineprotractor.com/privacy-policy"
  currentPath="/privacy-policy"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8">
    <div class="border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 font-mono mt-2">Last updated: September 11, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm space-y-6 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>AI Online Protractor</strong> (accessible at <a href="https://aionlineprotractor.com" class="text-blue-600 underline">https://aionlineprotractor.com</a>). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how it is used, and your rights regarding your data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">2. 100% Client-Side Processing</h2>
        <p>
          Our angle measurement tools, image uploads, and sensor readings operate entirely on the client side inside your web browser. When you upload an image to measure an angle, the image file is processed using local HTML5 FileReader APIs and is <strong>never uploaded to or stored on any external server</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">3. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
        <p>
          Like any other website, AI Online Protractor may use basic cookies and local browser storage (such as saving your preferred dark or light mode theme). These cookies do not contain personally identifiable information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">4. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          We may use Google AdSense and third-party advertising partners to display advertisements when you visit our website. These companies may use cookies (including the Google DoubleClick DART cookie) to serve ads based on your visit to this site and other sites on the internet.
        </p>
        <p>
          Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Google Ads Settings</a> or through the Network Advertising Initiative opt-out page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">5. Log Files & Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          AI Online Protractor follows standard internet log file procedures. The information collected by log files includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date/time stamps, referring/exit pages, and number of clicks. These are used solely to analyze trends, administer the site, and improve user experience.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">6. Children's Information</h2>
        <p>
          Protecting children online is paramount. AI Online Protractor does not knowingly collect any Personal Identifiable Information from children under the age of 13.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or suggestions regarding our Privacy Policy, please contact us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 underline">Contact Page</a> or by email at <span class="font-mono">hello@aionlineprotractor.com</span>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
